### Create an item (VS Code: install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request")
POST http://localhost:8000/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pen",
  "quantity": 10,
  "price": 2.5
}

### Get an item
GET http://localhost:8000/api/items/1

### Bad input -> 400
POST http://localhost:8000/api/items
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "quantity": -1
}

### Not found -> 404
GET http://localhost:8000/api/items/999
